      "explanation": "710 000 is 7.1 moved 5 places, so $10^5$. $249 \\times 1000 = 249\\,000$. $0.02 \\div 10^{-2} = 0.02 \\times 100 = 2$. $44\\,000 \\div 10^4 = 4.4$. $230 \\times 10^{-2} = 2.3$. $0.007 \\div 10^{-6} = 0.007 \\times 10^6 = 7000$.",
      "difficulty": "challenge"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1-q6",
